OL,3,GNEWSAPool named among 25 standout
OL,4,Aprojects across UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seawater lido has been named in a
OL,7,Flist of 25 standout projects to mark 50
OL,8,Fyears of The Architectural Heritage
OL,9,FFund.
OL,11,FThe charity, which promotes the
OL,12,Fconservation and sustainable re-use of
OL,13,Fhistoric buildings, said the projects
OL,14,Frange from medieval stone forts and
OL,15,FVictorian courthouses to industrial
OL,16,Fpotteries.
OL,18,FCornwall's Grade II listed art deco
OL,19,FJubilee Pool in Penzance is included in
OL,20,Fthe list.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
