OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fund said it had provided its
OL,7,F"largest-ever" heritage impact loan of
OL,8,F#850,000 towards a geothermal heating
OL,9,Fproject at the facility - the first of
OL,10,Fits kind in the UK ` to enable
OL,11,Fyear-round swimming.
